  "details": "I think it would be neat to have External Content portals. Meaning, a group of VRChat users can take advantage of VRChat for its matchmaking and social aspects, and then one user can drop a portal to an external VR-enabled game, partnered with VRChat. VRC would provide the machmaking API to facilitate a smooth transition between the games or via SteamVR, with the same friends auto-loading into your lobby. Perhaps you could also access the VRC friends list and reecive invites as if you were in-world. When you're done VRC could automatically relaunch and you'll be back in the first-party experience.",
